Original work
-------------
- The "Pip" mascot avatar (crates/goblin-ui-kit/src/mascot.rs) is an original design drawn
  procedurally from the UI kit's primitives. It does not copy the Muse app's avatar artwork.
- All widgets, the software renderer, the text stack, theme tokens and screens are original.

Design palette provenance
--------------------------
- Light-mode colour tokens and the eight chat-theme swatches were sampled from screenshots of
  the Muse Android app for visual continuity. Dark-mode tokens are
  original proposals. Colour values are not copyrightable; no app assets were copied.

